---
import SectionHead from "./SectionHead.astro";

const tools = [
  {
    name: "read",
    letter: "R",
    color: "coral",
    desc: "按范围读取文件，输出带行号，最多 64 KiB。单行过长会截断，预算满时给出下一次读取的 offset。",
    args: ["file_path", "offset", "limit"],
    foot: "默认最多 2000 行",
  },
  {
    name: "write",
    letter: "W",
    color: "yellow",
    desc: "创建或整份覆盖文件，父目录自动创建。适合新文件，不适合手术式修改。",
    args: ["file_path", "content"],
    foot: "父目录自动创建",
  },
  {
    name: "edit",
    letter: "E",
    color: "blue",
    desc: "精确字符串替换。old_string 必须只出现一次，除非 replace_all；改之前先 read，照抄原文。",
    args: ["file_path", "old_string", "new_string"],
    foot: "唯一匹配才动手",
  },
  {
    name: "bash",
    letter: "$",
    color: "mint",
    desc: "在当前目录执行 shell，默认 120 秒超时。输出只保留有界头尾，最多 64 KiB；Unix 下取消或超时会终止命令进程组中的子孙进程。搜索、构建、测试、git 都从这里走。",
    args: ["command", "timeout"],
    foot: "超时 120s，可调到 3600s",
  },
];
---

<section class="section" id="tools">
  <div class="wrap">
    <SectionHead num="02" kicker="TOOLS" tone="blue" title="整台机器，只有四块积木。">
      它们不是插件，就是工具集本身。工具失败不会中断循环——结果会带着 is_error 回到模型。
    </SectionHead>

    <div class="tool-grid">
      {
        tools.map((tool) => (
          <article class={`tool-card tool-card--${tool.color} reveal`}>
            <div class="tool-head">
              <h3 class="tool-name">{tool.name}</h3>
              <span class="tool-letter" aria-hidden="true">{tool.letter}</span>
            </div>
            <p class="tool-desc">{tool.desc}</p>
            <div class="tool-args">
              <span class="args-label">args</span>
              {tool.args.map((arg, i) => (
                <span>
                  <span class="k">{arg}</span>
                  {i < tool.args.length - 1 ? " · " : ""}
                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
            <p class="tool-foot">{tool.foot}</p>
          </article>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <div class="callout reveal">
      <span class="bang" aria-hidden="true">!</span>
      <p>
        <strong>工具失败不是异常。</strong>
        参数错了、文件不存在、命令非零退出——都会变成 <code>is_error: true</code> 的结果文本，继续喂回模型。循环不会因为一块积木掉地上就停下。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
